    metaDescription: "Complete guide to Strata roof repairs in Langley BC. Flat roof, pitched roof, drainage, moss treatment, contractor selection, costs, and insurance. Expert roofing for Strata buildings.",
    image: "images/blog-roof-repairs-langley.png",
